"Tankard lists every newer version of this cask, upgrades it with Upgrade All and auto-update, and replaces the app the way brew does." = "Tankard 会列出此 cask 的每个新版本，通过“全部升级”和自动更新进行升级，并以 brew 的方式替换 App。";
"Tankard looks for Homebrew where its installer puts it." = "Tankard 会在 Homebrew 安装程序放置它的位置查找 Homebrew。";
"Tankard needs App Management permission. Allow it in System Settings → Privacy & Security → App Management, relaunch Tankard, then try again." = "Tankard 需要“App 管理”权限。请在“系统设置”→“隐私与安全性”→“App 管理”中允许，重新启动 Tankard，然后重试。";
